  "description": "After waking up as an evil maid in a generic rated-R novel where skin-to-skin contact is needed to stop people from going berserk, the female lead is determined to change the ending of the novel so she can have it easy. For the greater good and to stop the male lead from going berserk, she \"teases\" the male lead a little bit. But after achieving her goal and helping the male lead get his power back, little did she know that he would get his revenge on her in the most unusual and unexpected way possible...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
